# Local dev secrets for `wrangler dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored).
#
# Set ONE of the following. The credential stays in the worker; only a
# placeholder ("proxy-injected") is forwarded into the container, and the
# outbound proxy swaps in the real value on calls to api.anthropic.com.

# Pay-per-token API key (recommended for production):
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# OR a Claude.ai subscription token. Get one with: claude setup-token
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
